<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Hideaway</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">WIMY</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Hideaway</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7FqIcvBJlqi66tgqzMdvY9</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.980" end="00:27.555">And were you on your phone?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.555" end="00:31.539">'Cause I called you like a million times before</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.539" end="00:39.539">But your line was busy though (Yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.792" end="00:43.008">Now am I all alone?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.008" end="00:47.462">Would you even wanna answer anymore?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.462" end="00:54.663">So that you can tell me I'm yours</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.663" end="00:58.877">I want you right here by my side</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.877" end="01:02.878">'Cause I'm dying to see your face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.878" end="01:09.150">You act like it's something to hideaway (Yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.150" end="01:14.510">Wondering if you could be my light?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.510" end="01:18.460">In the darkest times of space?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.460" end="01:26.460">You think that you're something to hideaway</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.051" end="01:41.804">Could I ever find</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.804" end="01:44.890">A way that would describe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.890" end="01:46.390">My peace of mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.213" end="01:48.882">Whеn you're with me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.882" end="01:53.460">But now I can't beliеve</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.460" end="01:57.212">I'm someone new</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.212" end="02:00.121">But you still have my time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.121" end="02:01.621">A piece of mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.508" end="02:04.094">I've given you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.094" end="02:11.406">What can I do?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.406" end="02:15.549">I want you right here by my side</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.549" end="02:19.482">'Cause I'm dying to see your face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.482" end="02:25.841">You act like it's something to hideaway (Yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.841" end="02:30.915">Wondering if you could be my light?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.915" end="02:35.178">In the darkest times of space?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.178" end="02:43.178">You think that you're something to hideaway</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.515" end="03:00.364">You know I love you.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.364" end="03:03.395">When you love me.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:03.395" end="03:11.395">Because you love me.It's you. It's all about you. It's about you.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:11.984" end="03:15.984">Goodbye.</p></div></body></tt>